ares (148+dfsg-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

From v148, the n64 core is only supported on amd64 and arm64. This is due to
changes upstream. Upstream may add additional architectures in the future
but the core needs to be disabled on non-amd64/non-arm64 for now. 

